{
  "id": "officer-training",
  "term": "officer training",
  "definition": "Officer training, in this context, means basic police education that includes teaching intended to help officers interact more adaptively and effectively with people who have mental illness. It may also include anti-stigma content to reduce discriminatory attitudes that can affect help-seeking and everyday life.",
